# Procurement approval policy in Stardog Rule Syntax (SRS).
# Load this Turtle file into urn:Procurement_Lab:Procurement in database procurement.
# Enable reasoning when querying. No Stride configuration is required.
# This file supplies the initial baseline. For the exercise, change the stored
# rule using the SPARQL Update in README step 5; leave this baseline unchanged.

@prefix : <http://example.org/procurement#> .

RULE :ApprovalRequirementRule
IF {
  ?o a :PurchaseOrder ;
     :amount ?a .
  FILTER(?a > 10000)
}
THEN {
  ?o a :HighValueOrder .
}
